    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Can you shoot well? And what about getting the beat at the same time? You will have to not only target opponents, but also get in time with different musical beatmaps. Listen to tracks with friends surrounded by pulsating music arenas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/3e38d040468151489d1da9e489d36244.poster.avif?t=1701105355\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/3e38d040468151489d1da9e489d36244.webm?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/3e38d040468151489d1da9e489d36244.mp4?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Kill opponents by shooting markers and improving your reaction time and track knowledge. Different weapons shoot differently with the same track markers: guns shoot notes of different durations adjusting to the changing BPM of tracks!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/2da2e831929ddee4d838932311af5a5d.poster.avif?t=1701105355\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/2da2e831929ddee4d838932311af5a5d.webm?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/2da2e831929ddee4d838932311af5a5d.mp4?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enjoy audio in music arenas that allow you to use different tactics for the same tracks.<br><br>DMCA and Copyright Information:<br>We specifically written music for the game so you can record videos for YouTube and stream on Twitch without any problems!",
    "about_the_game": "Can you shoot well? And what about getting the beat at the same time? You will have to not only target opponents, but also get in time with different musical beatmaps. Listen to tracks with friends surrounded by pulsating music arenas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/3e38d040468151489d1da9e489d36244.poster.avif?t=1701105355\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/3e38d040468151489d1da9e489d36244.webm?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/3e38d040468151489d1da9e489d36244.mp4?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Kill opponents by shooting markers and improving your reaction time and track knowledge. Different weapons shoot differently with the same track markers: guns shoot notes of different durations adjusting to the changing BPM of tracks!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/2da2e831929ddee4d838932311af5a5d.poster.avif?t=1701105355\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/2da2e831929ddee4d838932311af5a5d.webm?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575680/extras/2da2e831929ddee4d838932311af5a5d.mp4?t=1701105355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enjoy audio in music arenas that allow you to use different tactics for the same tracks.<br><br>DMCA and Copyright Information:<br>We specifically written music for the game so you can record videos for YouTube and stream on Twitch without any problems!",
